{"product_id":"getting-pregnant","title":"Getting Pregnant","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"467\"\u003eTrying to conceive can feel like navigating a maze—but \u003cem data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"190\"\u003eGetting Pregnant\u003c\/em\u003e is your map. Written by fertility expert Dr. Niels H. Lauersen and seasoned health writer Colette Bouchez, this comprehensive guide offers practical, evidence-based strategies to help couples maximize their chances of conception, no matter their age or fertility challenges.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"830\"\u003eInside, you’ll find guidance on medical treatments, lifestyle adjustments, natural techniques, and even a six-month fertility planner to track your journey. From understanding the role of diet, exercise, and daily habits, to exploring fertility drugs, donor options, and advanced treatments, this book combines medical expertise with clear, actionable advice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"1043\"\u003eWhether you’re just starting your journey or have faced obstacles along the way, \u003cem data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"931\"\u003eGetting Pregnant\u003c\/em\u003e empowers you with the knowledge, tools, and reassurance you need to take control of your reproductive health\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"1043\"\u003eAuthor: Niels Lauersen | Colette Bouchez \u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9780684864044 \u003cbr\u003eFormat: Paperback \u003cbr\u003ePages 592\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44997989564569,"sku":"6RC9780684864044","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/0765c6c47a01e16d6d057992a5e7d20a.jpg?v=1733677204","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/getting-pregnant","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}